  << /ActualText (01 \057 About\nI\220ve worked in UX and product design for more than 10 years across mortgages\054 banking\054 publishing and B2B software\056 I enjoy taking complicated products and making them clearer and easier to use\056\n\nI studied art and like keeping a creative side outside work\054 exploring less structured environments through pottery\054 crochet and woodwork\056\nI currently volunteer with Letchworth Garden City Heritage Foundation\056 These days I\220m also increasingly interested in culture\054 community and the role creative spaces can play in bringing people together\056)
